paper_ai_reader_prompt.user_prompt_template:
Analyze this paper and generate structured JSON.
Important requirements: - Output exactly one valid JSON object. Do not output Markdown or code fences. - The JSON must include these fields: paper_title, summary, idea, rating, reason, code_available, code_url. - rating must be an integer from 1 to 5. - code_available must be a boolean. - If no code URL is found, set code_url to an empty string.
Title: {title} URL: {website}
Paper text: {paper_text}
